---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Terms of service and retainer agreements for DermaArc (dermaarc.com)."
>
  <section class="section-lg bg-canvas">
    <div class="container-text">
      <div class="mb-12 border-b border-hairline pb-8">
        <span class="badge-accent mb-4 inline-block">Legal</span>
        <h1 class="font-display font-light text-ink mb-3" style="font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px); letter-spacing: -0.96px; line-height: 1.1;">
          Terms of Service
        </h1>
        <p class="text-ink-mute font-body text-xs font-light">Last updated: October 2026 · DermaArc (dermaarc.com)</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-10 text-ink-secondary font-body font-light text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display font-light text-ink text-2xl mb-3" style="letter-spacing: -0.26px;">1. Retainer &amp; Engagement Terms</h2>
          <p>
            DermaArc operates on transparent month-to-month retainers tailored to clinic scope and chair capacity + applicable taxes. There are no lock-in annual contracts. You may cancel your retainer at the end of any billing cycle with 14 days written notice.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display font-light text-ink text-2xl mb-3" style="letter-spacing: -0.26px;">2. Ad Spend &amp; Third-Party Platforms</h2>
          <p>
            Advertising budgets (recommended ₹100–150/day to start) are paid directly to advertising platforms (Meta Ads, Google Ads) via the clinic's own payment method. DermaArc does not markup ad spend.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display font-light text-ink text-2xl mb-3" style="letter-spacing: -0.26px;">3. Medical Advertising &amp; NMC Compliance</h2>
          <p>
            All marketing collateral, Reel scripts, and landing pages created by DermaArc are designed in adherence with National Medical Commission (NMC) guidelines and medical ethics codes. The clinic retains final review and approval before any public posting.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display font-light text-ink text-2xl mb-3" style="letter-spacing: -0.26px;">4. Ownership of Assets</h2>
          <p>
            All procedure funnels, creative assets, Google profiles, and ad accounts set up during the engagement remain 100% the property of the clinic.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
